      "updated": 1790529851073,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Core Entities: User, Chat, Message, Client\n\nWebSocket Commands:\n- From Client\n    - createChat\n        // -> createChat\n        {\n            \"participants\": [],\n            \"name\": \"\"\n        } -> {\n            \"chatId\": \"\"\n        }\n\n    - sendMessage\n        // -> sendMessage\n        {\n            \"chatId\": \"\",\n            \"message\": \"\",\n            \"attachments\": []\n        } -> {\n            \"status\": \"SUCCESS\" | \"FAILURE\",\n            \"messageId\": \"\"\n        }\n\n    - addAttachments\n        // -> createAttachment\n        {\n            \"body\": ...,\n            \"hash\": \n        } -> {\n            \"attachmentId\": \"\"\n        }\n\n    - modifyParticipants\n        // -> modifyChatParticipants\n        {\n            \"chatId\": \"\",\n            \"userId\": \"\",\n            \"operation\": \"ADD\" | \"REMOVE\"\n        } -> \"SUCCESS\" | \"FAILURE\"\n\n- From Server\n    - When a chat is created or updated\n        // <- chatUpdate\n        {\n            \"chatId\": \"\",\n            \"participants\": [],\n        } -> \"RECEIVED\"\n\n    - When a message is received\n        // <- newMessage\n        {\n            \"chatId\": \"\",\n            \"userId\": \"\"\n            \"message\": \"\",\n            \"attachments\": []\n        } -> \"RECEIVED\"\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "faHp-6W_dyTQznuJrPlCH",
      "originalText": "Core Entities: User, Chat, Message, Client\n\nWebSocket Commands:\n- From Client\n    - createChat\n        // -> createChat\n        {\n            \"participants\": [],\n            \"name\": \"\"\n        } -> {\n            \"chatId\": \"\"\n        }\n\n    - sendMessage\n        // -> sendMessage\n        {\n            \"chatId\": \"\",\n            \"message\": \"\",\n            \"attachments\": []\n        } -> {\n            \"status\": \"SUCCESS\" | \"FAILURE\",\n            \"messageId\": \"\"\n        }\n\n    - addAttachments\n        // -> createAttachment\n        {\n            \"body\": ...,\n            \"hash\": \n        } -> {\n            \"attachmentId\": \"\"\n        }\n\n    - modifyParticipants\n        // -> modifyChatParticipants\n        {\n            \"chatId\": \"\",\n            \"userId\": \"\",\n            \"operation\": \"ADD\" | \"REMOVE\"\n        } -> \"SUCCESS\" | \"FAILURE\"\n\n- From Server\n    - When a chat is created or updated\n        // <- chatUpdate\n        {\n            \"chatId\": \"\",\n            \"participants\": [],\n        } -> \"RECEIVED\"\n\n    - When a message is received\n        // <- newMessage\n        {\n            \"chatId\": \"\",\n            \"userId\": \"\"\n            \"message\": \"\",\n            \"attachments\": []\n        } -> \"RECEIVED\"\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
